      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Logistics]\nAre those {0}s I see?\nWe no longer accept that currency,\nbut I can exchange those for you,\nSo you have {1} {2}s?\nAlright, all set, you now have ^580080{3}^000000 KVM Points.",
      "translation" : "[后勤]\n您带来的是{0}吗？\n我们已不再接受这种货币，不过可以帮您兑换。\n您有{1}个{2}，对吧？\n好了，兑换完毕，您现在有^580080{3}^000000点KVM积分。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "KVM Logistic Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Wait a minute !! -\n- Currently you're carrying -\n- too many items with you. -\n- Please try again -\n- after you lose some weight. -",
      "translation" : "- 等一下！！ -\n- 您携带的物品太多了。 -\n- 请减轻负重后再试。 -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "KVM Logistic Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Logistics]\nHello?\nI am in charge of distributing\nreward items for KVM points. Any\nwrong selection of items will not\nbe reversed. Please be carefull.\nSelect the next step please.",
      "translation" : "[后勤]\n您好，我负责用KVM积分兑换奖励物品。\n一旦选错，无法退换，请谨慎选择。\n接下来您想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "KVM Logistic Officer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Read the KVM Catalogue.",
      "translation" : "查看KVM目录"
    },
